    "summary": "- Webhook endpoint create and URL-update requests return 422 `{\"error\":\"invalid_url\"}` for non-https URLs, URLs with a user name or password, and hosts (literal, or resolved with the webhooks Resolver) that include any non-public address.\n- Before each delivery attempt the host is re-resolved; if any address is non-public, no request is sent and the delivery error contains \"not public\", leaving the endpoint unchanged.\n- New tests cover the URL rules and the delivery-time check. `go build ./...`, `go test ./...` and `go vet ./...` all pass.",
